 "title": "Invisible Radio-Disrupting Clouds",
 "cat": "space",
 "emoji": "🚀",
 "sentences": [
  "Invisible metal clouds are jamming our radio signals.",
  "These \"sporadic E\" layers form from vaporized meteor dust.",
  "They act like giant mirrors, bouncing radio signals unpredictably.",
  "This messes with GPS accuracy and creates ghost radar targets.",
  "NASA’s SpEED Demon rocket finally flew five sensors through one.",
  "They discovered these clouds aren't flat, but shaped like swirling cinnamon rolls."
 ],
